{
  "_readme": "The pictures on the Brain Flash board (Ch6), cropped from the book's board artwork (source/artwork/BRAIN FLASH GAME A:W.ai) on 2026-11-07. The board is a 6 by 6 grid: the first die gives the number along the bottom (the column) and the second the number up the side (the row), as in the book's example, where a 5 and a 3 land on juggling skittles. The artwork is covered by the 'board-game-artwork' entry in rights.json (owned by the authors). Two of the 36 pictures are left out for a workplace site, a pistol (column 2, row 4) and a bikini (column 2, row 5), so 34 are used; a roll that lands on a missing space is rolled again. The names are ours, for the alt text and captions. Mark reviews, including whether to put the two back.",
